{"id": "prc-federal-payroll-documentation", "title": "PRC auditors found gaps in payroll records for two federal HIV programs", "seconds": 61.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "042c339d779de337", "words": 143, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "For 22 samples in an HIV grant, PRC’s auditors could not locate time cards.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.42, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Where", "were", "the", "time", "cards?"], "sub": "PRC payroll audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.73, 1.23, 1.34, 1.48, 2.04, 3.05, 4.03, 4.62, 4.8, 5.0, 5.43, 5.74]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "In a housing grant, auditors could not trace how PRC allocated direct-service payroll.", "t0": 6.54, "t1": 12.09, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit22", "kicker": "PRC, independent audit by Harshwal & Company, LLP", "text": "Finding 2022-002", "mark": "Finding 2022-002"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.19, 0.55, 1.28, 1.88, 2.07, 2.28, 2.75, 2.99, 3.77, 4.37, 5.07]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The question about the City’s follow-up is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 12.21, "t1": 16.76, "shot": "city-question", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "City review of the correction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.6, 0.82, 0.94, 1.35, 2.32, 2.55, 2.63, 3.68, 3.91, 4.0]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "They could not determine how much payroll to question.", "t0": 16.88, "t1": 19.63, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Questioned costs undetermined"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.68, 1.23, 1.35, 1.56, 2.04, 2.15]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "PRC said it introduced quarterly time studies in January 2023.", "t0": 19.85, "t1": 24.27, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit22", "kicker": "PRC, independent audit by Harshwal & Company, LLP", "text": "Quarterly time studies", "mark": "Quarterly time studies"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.66, 0.88, 1.0, 1.57, 2.07, 2.39, 2.79, 2.91, 3.39, 3.72]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "It required supervisors to approve time allocations and reported reviewing earlier entries.", "t0": 24.39, "t1": 30.25, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Payroll approval", "sub": "Time allocations"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.66, 1.34, 1.48, 2.02, 2.35, 3.28, 3.7, 4.22, 4.81, 5.28]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "amount"], "text": "The City later reported a 3 million dollar rehabilitation subaward for Leland House.", "t0": 30.47, "t1": 36.1, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,000,000", "label": "later Leland House rehabilitation subaward"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.6, 0.95, 1.5, 1.59, 1.97, 2.45, 2.81, 3.69, 4.51, 4.73, 5.14]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "timeline[2]", "timeline[3]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "That report came 60 days after the Clearinghouse accepted the earlier audit.", "t0": 36.22, "t1": 41.55, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "Clearinghouse and City records", "heading": "Audit and subaward dates", "source": "fac", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "FY2022 audit accepted", "event": "2023-08-02"}, {"icon": "lease", "label": "Leland House subaward reported", "event": "2023-10-01"}, {"icon": "audit", "label": "FY2023 audit accepted", "event": "2024-04-01"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.76, 1.09, 1.6, 2.13, 2.43, 2.54, 3.52, 4.23, 4.41, 4.88]}, {"scene": "agreement", "kind": "record", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "established[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "The audit did not identify misspending under that later award.", "t0": 41.67, "t1": 46.0, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Federal payroll audit", "heading": "What the records quantify", "source": "audit22", "rows": [{"icon": "audit", "label": "FY2022 questioned payroll", "value": "Could not determine"}, {"icon": "lease", "label": "Later rehabilitation subaward", "value": "$3,000,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.74, 1.02, 1.35, 2.0, 3.08, 3.34, 3.54, 3.85]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The following audit listed the payroll finding as resolved.", "t0": 46.22, "t1": 49.53, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit23", "kicker": "PRC, independent audit by Harshwal & Company, LLP", "text": "Finding 2022-002 resolved", "mark": "Finding 2022-002 resolved"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.65, 0.99, 1.37, 1.49, 1.98, 2.44, 2.64]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Clearinghouse accepted that audit in April 2024.", "t0": 49.65, "t1": 53.61, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "April 1, 2024", "sub": "FY2023 audit accepted"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.88, 1.39, 1.59, 1.97, 2.21, 2.74, 3.15]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The record does not show when the City reviewed corrective action.", "t0": 53.73, "t1": 57.78, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["City review of corrective action", "FY2022 payroll amount"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.56, 0.79, 1.01, 1.78, 2.01, 2.15, 2.49, 3.01, 3.55]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 57.9, "t1": 60.41, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.37, 0.48, 0.57, 1.41, 1.63, 1.74]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The payroll audit", "response": "Changes to payroll records", "agreement": "The later housing subaward", "close": "Resolution"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "question"}